{"overview":"داگ، نمایشنامه‌نویس خسته و معلم تئاتر مدرسهٔ متوسطه، می‌فهمد که معشوق سابقش با رقیبش، مدیر مدرسه، در رابطه است؛ برای انتقام و برای جلوگیری از دریافت جایزهٔ نوار آبی، داگ به‌صورت مخفیانهٔ‌نقش‌پذیری‌ترین نمایش ممکن را می‌آراید.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Doug, a frustrated playwright and middle school theater teacher, learns his ex is dating his nemesis, the school principal. To get revenge and cost him a Blue Ribbon Award, Doug secretly stages the most inappropriate play imaginable.","tagline_en":"It's not personal. It's middle school.","runtime":84,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Giselle Bonilla"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Will Brill","role":"Doug","photo":"/eTPXcvxlquT8ppKnwAe2a3CzI90.jpg"},{"name":"گیلیان جیکوبز","role":"Abigail","photo":"/tKpXn260glPElCKlFekKAACNWYn.jpg","en":"Gillian Jacobs"},{"name":"راب لاو","role":"Principal Brady","photo":"/uY0u865QqHqT0YBtwdBXFfVI6Hr.jpg","en":"Rob Lowe"},{"name":"Nevada Jose","role":"Little Mikey Gomez (LMG)","photo":"/2NKOthwy9zt84IjtQykOpzglIDY.jpg"},{"name":"Melanie Herrera","role":"Lata","photo":"/3DPBpdxjNmyhwlDqwB9prFUQK2V.jpg"},{"name":"Chyler Emery Stern","role":"Cindy","photo":"/mrPtF3P6sBs0b9ydbUV4LFEtF1k.jpg"},{"name":"Karen Maruyama","role":"Mrs. Belkin","photo":"/4OiYvBQlq0sxcrFH7GFDzIzYqMe.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Strassner","role":"Carson","photo":"/yRvs8qHr39WLQpBMQEfVy2t3zUj.jpg"},{"name":"Lili Alice","role":"Lili","photo":"/la4D47Gy4NMkHWdH8QWrq8Miotb.jpg"},{"name":"Cayden Romero","role":"Brian","photo":"/7n7EVJOtkaXiTyf3j27nGnDtPU9.jpg"},{"name":"Hannes Schaller","role":"Young Principal Brady","photo":""},{"name":"Kor Wren","role":"Caleb","photo":"/9XcnvjG2bUzHu7zIRCmDuA1DlY7.jpg"}],"trailer":"DaDzxM68BYc","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1579941"}